abstract: "Research archive containing a candidate classification of prime tile counts in Erdos problem 634, a two-piece construction with a complete fixed-tile count spectrum for one rational target family, and exact coordinate certificates including a 322-tile example. The full all-integer classification is not claimed. Original software is MIT licensed; original manuscripts and documentation are CC BY 4.0."
